  "prefLabel": "Tre 103.01 Requests for Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tre 103.01 Requests for Information. Consistent with RSA 91-A, information relating to the treasury is available for public inspection during normal working hours. Information that is available for public inspection may be copied at a cost of $.20 per page to be paid by the person requesting the information.\n\nSource. #7588, eff 11-7-01; ss by #9574, eff 10-22-09\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tre100.html"
